Third-party notices
===================

The Preeti key table (src/aksharkit/data/font_preeti.json) was written for
aksharkit by comparing, key by key, the Preeti tables published in the four
MIT-licensed projects below, and keeping the entries on which they agree.
scripts/preeti_sources.json records, with attribution, the values each of
those projects states for each key. No code, file or rule list from any of
them is included; the conversion code is aksharkit's own. The notices below
are reproduced as the MIT License asks. See docs/preeti.md for the comparison.

